"""Course-package data for full curriculum specifications (Batch 1 + Batch 2).

Batch 1 domain/lesson/sample data stays in data_curricula.CURRICULA (keyed by
legacy key). This module adds the section-7 package elements the master prompt
requires for every module (two worked applications + one common misconception)
and an integrative case per course, and defines Batch 2.

Evidence labels:
- verified-official-source: the official page was read this session (Microsoft
  Learn MCP for Microsoft/GitHub exams; code.claude.com via WebFetch).
- vendor-docs-partial: official product documentation read for some claims
  only; other lessons are Mastemy design and say so.
- n/a-no-official-syllabus: no issuer syllabus exists; outcomes are Mastemy
  internal IDs derived from the master prompt's stated requirements.
Worked-application titles and misconceptions are Mastemy design content
(drafted by an AI agent, not SME-reviewed).
"""

OFFICIAL = "verified-official-source"
PARTIAL = "vendor-docs-partial"
NOSYL = "n/a-no-official-syllabus"

